  "comments": "<p><i><u>Composition:</u></i><br><br>Three different alloys were used for this type:<br>1850-1851: 5% silver, 60% copper, 25% zinc, 10% nickel<br>1872-1873: 5% silver, 85% copper, 5% zinc, 5% nickel<br>1874-1877: 5% silver, 65% copper, 20% zinc, 10% nickel<br><br>According to Richter and Kunzmann, \"Neuer HMZ-katalog\", 2011, the alloys were different:<br>1850-1851: 15% silver, 50% copper, 25% zinc, 10% nickel<br>1872-1877: 15% silver, 75% copper, 5% zinc, 5% nickel<br><br><i><u>Mintmark varieties:</u></i><br><br><strong>No mintmark</strong> variety:<br><i>Mint:</i> Strasbourg<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/60415198de106.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/60415198de106.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.sincona.com/\">Sincona AG</a><br><br><strong>AB mintmark</strong> variety:<br><i>Mint:</i> Strasbourg<br><i>Mintmark:</i> AB monogram on obverse<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6041520436efa.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6041520436efa.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.sincona.com/\">Sincona AG</a><br><br><strong>B mintmark</strong> variety:<br><i>Mint:</i> Bern<br><i>Mintmark:</i> B on reverse<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6041521f5407a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6041521f5407a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.tauleryfau.com/\">Tauler &amp; Fau Subastas</a><br><br><strong>BB mintmark</strong> variety:<br><i>Mint:</i> Strasbourg<br><i>Mintmark:</i> BB monogram on reverse<br><i>Mint master:</i> baron Alfred Renouard de Bussière<br><i>Mint master's mark:</i> bee at the bottom left<br><i>Chief engraver:</i> Jean-Jacques Barre<br><i>Engraver's mark:</i> greyhound head at the bottom right<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6041525a65212.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6041525a65212.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.lugdunum-numismatik.com/\">Lugdunum Gmbh</a></p>",
